<title>SOUTH AFRICA: VAAL REEFS SEPT QTR AVAILABLE PROFIT SLIPS.</title>
<headline>VAAL REEFS SEPT QTR AVAILABLE PROFIT SLIPS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-September</p>
<p>versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Available profit		 92.8   vs 102.1</p>
<p>    Capital spending		101.5   vs  97.7</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled		 3,433,000 vs 3,272,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)		 16,968 vs 16,147</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)		     4.94 vs 4.93</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)		   38,946 vs 37,465</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		54,800 vs 53,015    </p>
<p>Full name: Vaal Reefs Exploration and Mining Co Ltd, managed by Anglo American Corp of South Africa Ltd. </p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
